			"Message": "docs(Mist): Enrich funding section with Land intro and table headers\n\nExpand the Funding & Acknowledgements section with a welcoming preamble introducing Land as an open-source endeavor, add a proper table header row identifying the four logos (Land, PlayForm, NLnet, NGI0 Commons Fund), and update the NLnet program description with a link to the project page. Also incorporate a sentence of context alongside the changelog link.\n\nNo semantic changes to the project's technical documentation.",
